---
title: French 75
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Our own
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @gin{2%fl_oz} and @lemon juice{1%fl_oz}. Add @superfine sugar{2%tsp}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #champagne flute{}(well chilled). Top with @champagne{1.5%fl_oz}. Garnish with a @lemon peel{1}(spiral cut) and a @cocktail cherry{1}.
